# Local secrets for scripts/mp-e2e.mjs — DO NOT commit real values.
# Copy to `.env.mp` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# NEXT SESSION: grab a branded MP test account (seller test user) and its test
# card from our Mercado Pago panel (app 5587803867385421 / test users) and run
# the full E2E: `node scripts/mp-e2e.mjs`. The sandbox merchant could not
# tokenize the default MCO test cards (E202/G001) and SDK secure-fields are
# not automatable, so use an account/card the panel itself accepts first.
#
# To get a STORE_JWT without handling JWT_SECRET, run the real storefront login
# and paste the token into STORE_JWT. Otherwise set JWT_SECRET (ask the operator)
# and STORE_USER_ID to a real D1 users.id (e.g. 10 for technicelu@gmail.com).

# --- Store auth ---
# STORE_JWT=eyJ...            # preferred: paste a real login token
# JWT_SECRET=                 # only if minting locally
# STORE_USER_ID=10            # D1 users.id for the order's payer

# --- Mercado Pago (test/sandbox) ---
MP_PUBLIC_KEY=APP_USR-97cbd8b4-2155-4508-a401-2f89e3373db9
# MP_CARD_TOKEN=              # reuse an already-minted token, or let it mint:
MP_CARD_NUMBER=5254133674403564
MP_CARD_YEAR=2030
MP_CARD_MONTH=11
MP_CARD_CVV=123
MP_CARDHOLDER_NAME=APRO
MP_DOC_TYPE=CC
MP_DOC_NUMBER=123456789

# --- Network ---
# API_BASE=https://api.tecnicelu.store